      ],
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": "wx-1130-01",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "刚才谢谢你。你手腕还好吗？",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-11-30 19:24",
          "read": true
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1130-02",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "没事。你呢？我刚才也突然疼了一下。",
          "senderId": "owner",
          "time": "2026-11-30 19:26",
          "read": true
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1130-03",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "不是碰到的那种疼。像是有人隔着很远，和我同时碰到了同一个地方。",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-11-30 19:29",
          "read": true
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1130-04",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "我本来以为是巧合。你也这么觉得吗？",
          "senderId": "owner",
          "time": "2026-11-30 19:32",
          "read": true
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1201-01",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "早。你醒了吗？昨晚后来有没有再疼？",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-01 07:56",
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1201-02",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "我刚刚拿杯子的时候，右手腕突然像被轻轻拧了一下。你那边呢？",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-01 09:14",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1201-03",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "我也有感觉。我记下时间了，看看是不是同一秒。",
          "senderId": "owner",
          "time": "2026-12-01 09:18",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-photo-01",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-01 12:22",
          "kind": "image",
          "media": "",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false,
          "meta": {
            "assetKey": "photo-01",
            "linkedAlbumId": "album-photo-01"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1202-01",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "今天练习到一半，突然觉得你那边应该也醒着。很奇怪，我居然开始习惯先问你。",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-02 10:08",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1203-01",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "刚才那一下情绪来得很突然。我没有在想什么，但一下子很难受。你也感觉到了吗？",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-03 22:41",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-photo-02",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-04 18:16",
          "kind": "image",
          "media": "",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false,
          "meta": {
            "assetKey": "photo-02",
            "linkedAlbumId": "album-photo-02"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1204-01",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "今天路上看到一只很笨的猫。拍得有点糊，还是想给你看。",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-04 18:17",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1205-01",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "你今天怎么没说话？不是催你。只是看到好笑的东西，第一反应还是想发给你。",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-05 20:03",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1206-01",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "如果有一天这种感觉突然没有了，我们是不是就不会再这样联系了？",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-06 23:12",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1207-01",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "今天好像真的没有了。手腕不疼了，心里也安静了。谢谢你这几天一直认真听我说。以后也好好过自己的生活。",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-07 21:06",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1207-02",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "嗯。你也是。",
          "senderId": "owner",
          "time": "2026-12-07 21:10",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1202-02",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "你今天还疼吗？",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-02 10:16",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1202-03",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "早上有一点，后来就没了。你呢？",
          "senderId": "owner",
          "time": "2026-12-02 10:19",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1202-04",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "我也是。好像不是一直连着，只有突然的时候才会。",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-02 10:22",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1202-05",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "那我们先把时间记下来。至少能知道它什么时候出现。",
          "senderId": "owner",
          "time": "2026-12-02 10:25",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1203-02",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "今天有点烦。不是身体疼，是突然觉得什么都做不好。",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-03 22:46",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1203-03",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "我刚刚也很低落，但我不知道是不是因为你。",
          "senderId": "owner",
          "time": "2026-12-03 22:49",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1203-04",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "如果真的是这样，那我以后心情不好是不是也会影响你？",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-03 22:52",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1203-05",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "也可能只是我们刚好都累了。先别把所有事都怪到这件事上。",
          "senderId": "owner",
          "time": "2026-12-03 22:55",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1204-02",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "那只猫后来又出现了。我今天路过的时候它还在原地。",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-04 18:21",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1204-03",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "你是不是专门绕过去看它的？",
          "senderId": "owner",
          "time": "2026-12-04 18:23",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1204-04",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "被发现了。它比我想象中还不怕人。",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-04 18:26",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1205-02",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "今天路上听到有人放那首歌，突然想起你。",
          "senderId": "owner",
          "time": "2026-12-05 20:16",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1205-03",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "哪首？",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-05 20:17",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1205-04",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "《一天一天》。可能只是因为最近总在听。",
          "senderId": "owner",
          "time": "2026-12-05 20:19",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1205-05",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "我也听过。下次你听的时候告诉我，看看我会不会也有感觉。",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-05 20:22",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1206-extra-01",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "我今天试着没去想那种感觉。结果反而一直在看手机。",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-06 22:42",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        },
        {
          "id": "wx-1206-extra-02",
          "title": "苏新皓",
          "body": "你有没有觉得，我们最近好像把它当成每天都要确认的事了？",
          "senderId": "su",
          "time": "2026-12-06 22:46",
          "hidden": true,
          "read": false
        }
